{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death gave you seven days. Now it wants to play cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discarding Death is a single-player card game where you face Death in daily rounds using a standard deck. Each day, you draw five cards and compare them against Death's hand. Every comparison gives you three choices \u2014 each one shifts your Health, Mental, Soul, or Funds. Keep all four above zero and you live another day. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600330?t=1769575036","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600330?t=1769575036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600330/726ce108ca0e387d932cee974ba982c1dc8efa37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769575036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600330/726ce108ca0e387d932cee974ba982c1dc8efa37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769575036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death gave you seven days. Now it wants to play cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discarding Death is a single-player card game where you face Death in daily rounds using a standard deck. Each day, you draw five cards and compare them against Death's hand. Every comparison gives you three choices \u2014 each one shifts your Health, Mental, Soul, or Funds. Keep all four above zero and you live another day. </p>","developers":["Tin Smajlagi\u0107"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"he